 r←commandRequestBody rqbContent;hasRef;comp;reqbody;propnames;values
 ⍝ TODO, make sure this can handle all request body contents
 hasRef←{6::0 ⋄ (2=⍵.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref')∨2=⍵.(⍎⊃⎕NL ¯9).schema.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref'}rqbContent ⍝ Can ref be anywhere else
 :If hasRef
     comp←getComponent rqbContent
     r←(2⊃⎕RSI).⎕NEW comp
 :ElseIf rqbContent.(0≠⎕NC'⍙application⍙47⍙json')
     reqbody←(2⊃⎕RSI).⎕NS ⍬
     (propnames values)←{(⊂p),⊂defaultValue¨⍵⍎¨p←⍵.⎕NL ¯9}rqbContent.⍙application⍙47⍙json.schema.properties
     reqbody{⍺.{⍎⍺,'←⍵'}/⍵}¨↓propnames,⍪values
     r←reqbody
 :ElseIf rqbContent.(0≠⎕NC'⍙multipart⍙47⍙mixed⍙59⍙boundary⍙61⍙request⍙45⍙separator')
     ∘∘∘
 :ElseIf rqbContent.(0≠⎕NC'⍙application⍙47⍙octet⍙45⍙stream')
     ∘∘∘
 :Else
     ∘∘∘
 :EndIf
